  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Children are protected - Nepal</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Programme activities to transform social, cultural and gender norms for reduction of violence against children, including child marriage and teenage pregnancy, also with a focus on returning married girls and teenage mothers to school. Other partners: Karnali Integrated Rural Development and Research Centre (KIRDARC), Everest Club (EC) Dailekh,</narrative>
  </description>
